# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Rust sources are checked out as LF wherever the clone happens, whatever
# `core.autocrlf` the machine that clones carries: rustfmt writes LF, git stores LF,
# and a worktree whose files disagree with that is one `cargo fmt` rewrites on sight.
# CI checks out the same bytes, so a formatting run answers the same there as here.
*.rs text eol=lf
